(74, 83, '0419077104', 'Dr.Eng. Handri Santoso, S.Si.,M.Eng.', NULL, 'lektor', 6, '1971-07-19', '089635724707', NULL, 1, 16, 'Dr. Handri is a distinguished expert in digital transformation and artificial intelligence, with a focused specialization in developing innovative solutions for industrial processes. He brings extensive experience in the software development lifecycle (SDLC) and project management, alongside a deep technical foundation in instrumentation and control engineering for industrial applications. Dr. Handri is proficient in various programming languages, including C/C++, Python, and R, and leverages powerful tools such as Orange, RapidMiner, and Sparx EA to drive results. With a strong background in AI and machine learning, he excels in deploying deep learning models to enhance energy efficiency, optimize industrial automation, and propel research and development initiatives.', '1731552918-83.jpg', 14, 8690840571, 363519281412000, 5977715, 'https://sinta.kemdikbud.go.id/authors/profile/5977715', 'https://scholar.google.co.id/citations?user=7bA33soAAAAJ&hl=en', '13', '[\"390\",\"393\",\"401\",\"404\",\"407\"]', '[\"541\",\"546\",\"548\",\"549\"]', 83, 83, NULL, '2024-11-14 03:07:30'),
